            },
            {
              "id": "tny.II.t.preterit.4",
              "sense": null,
              "turoyo": "Lu greʕo twəḷḷe u+koso du+malko. Lu+malko lo mtanele aʕme, lo twəḷḷe ʕarz diḏe (lo məḷḷele mede ḥarbo, bas u+greʕo ġalabe nafəl qəm ruḥe ‘he was very much upset’)",
              "translation": "he did not insult him",
